DEFINE QUOTA ON DATABASE app RULE tables FOR TABLE MATCH REGEX /.*/ LIMIT 10;
DEFINE QUOTA OVERWRITE ON DATABASE app EXPECT GENERATION 1 RULE fields FOR FIELD MATCH EXACT person LIMIT UNLIMITED;
ALTER QUOTA ON DATABASE app EXPECT GENERATION 2 SET RULE records FOR RECORD MATCH EXACT person LIMIT 100 DROP RULE IF EXISTS fields;
REMOVE QUOTA IF EXISTS ON DATABASE app EXPECT GENERATION 3;
REBUILD QUOTA IF NEEDED ON DATABASE app;
INFO FOR QUOTA ON DATABASE app STRUCTURE;
